      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哼，你跟谁说话呢？　我可是已经被称为\nＧⅠ级别的优秀马娘。你真觉得自己能赢吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaaa12f670b61b677302c3140cfece0c9e804d1985f7b629ee5b12fc5f5b71ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
