      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下次对决就到闪耀系列赛上吧。前辈的话一定能在那上\n轻松取胜吧。好好发挥，一定会成为大家理想的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b96116efd1b58dec9da8eef82e933b4cfd5c90c23e16db24ad47238b9a179227",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
