    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284c5369bb68d07904cdd9a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀ー，偶尔去下夏季庙会也不错啊。\n啊ー，卖够了卖够了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c883334b1c17288b6459057195365349f23c67a0e11edcc23aed924c7424ff64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
