    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89dbe7a16a8b20b815d30328",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，还是卖的更多吧。\n我其实是被炒面店的大叔拜托去摊位上帮忙了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ef57e046e3fed7833030f8a3ed1499b9ad3932a4ecc69b2171b84c2a7cebc0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
