    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e3db960f2b13a89038c32f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那场沙滩上的比赛时，我似乎明白了。\n我所追求的帅气。就是说，两者都有就好了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "830f4c561ce3ecc58d38f097f77a7fbcc8de10288a4fca8ada87935908e6ca3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
