      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "用帅气的跑法拿下绝对的胜利！　然后，再说出帅气\n的话！　这样的话，就永远不会输到不甘心了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e181c9e3e6f7302246ae34f63b41302d4d8ae34ba093041f3f5e2668d47356f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
