      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――能赢。靠我发明的『炸裂式跑法』的话！\n好嘞！　我去去就回，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70fb3319c6e909c7a5b0dfb5f4237690ae216ed39ed932ac66099a0ac3f4bd1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
